{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝馬國明、視后楊茜堯、林夏薇、陳自瑤、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、黃庭鋒及鄺潔楹今日（22日）現身廣州，出席主演台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》「主創見面會」廣州場，跟市民見面分享拍攝感受，並重演劇中名場面，吸引過百粉絲到場支持，場面熱鬧！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:03:52.490225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:16:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.258371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.258371+00:00","content_hash":"b2f6c5b9c645adeba632672ffc2f8c1f885638574a5f2af15d4e95f75d1f22c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}